        <remarks>
          <para>Creates a new ProtectionDomain with the given CodeSource and permissions. If permissions is not null, then setReadOnly() will be called on the passed in permissions. The permissions granted to this domain are static, i.e. invoking the staticPermissionsOnly() method returns true. They contain only the ones passed to this constructor and the current policy will not be consulted.</para>
